{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493417,"name":"Elizabeth Rotman","username":"Elizabeth_Rotman","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/a3d4f5/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T03:04:53.150Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot frozen and stuck sending on Mac after local update and reset. Please recover/recreate my Agent Computer on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is ongoing.  I cannot use Grok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.55.0\u003cbr\u003e\nBuilt: 2026-09-16T07:46:00.554Z\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493417-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493417-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T04:24:00.651Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":14,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":71.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171952,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-frozen-and-stuck-sending-on-mac-after-local-update-and-reset-please-recover-recreate-my-agent-computer-on-the-backend","display_username":"Elizabeth Rotman","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138290,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-frozen-and-stuck-sending-on-mac-after-local-update-and-reset-please-recover-recreate-my-agent-computer-on-the-backend/171952/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":493458,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T04:23:25.334Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/elizabeth_rotman\"\u003e@Elizabeth_Rotman\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report, and sorry for the confusion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, the good news. Your Agent Computer is totally fine, and there’s nothing we need to restore or recreate on our side. The bots ran normally all day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat actually happened is that the included usage that comes with the Grok Bot free trial was fully used up. After that, every message you send, including from newly created bots, gets rejected before the bot can reply. At that point the app should show a clear notice like “trial usage used”, but right now it doesn’t, so it looks like things are stuck or frozen on “sending”. This is a known issue we’re tracking, and I’ve passed it to the team. I don’t have an exact timeline yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can confirm this in Grok Bot: Settings \u0026gt; Usage. You should see “You’ve used all of your trial usage” and options to continue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease don’t use Reset, Update, or Recover for this, and you don’t need to reinstall either. Your bots, files, and logins are safe. Sent messages won’t go through until there’s available usage again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf Settings \u0026gt; Usage shows you still have trial usage left, let me know and I’ll dig deeper.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T04:23:25.334Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":5.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171952,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-frozen-and-stuck-sending-on-mac-after-local-update-and-reset-please-recover-recreate-my-agent-computer-on-the-backend","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/gr